{%- comment -%}
  "Gift card created" notification – email body.

  Campaign switch: gift cards issued by the gift-card-promo tool carry
  template_suffix = "gift-card-promo" (GIFT_CARD_TEMPLATE_SUFFIX in .env). Those get the
  promo version below, which never shows the amount. Gift cards created any other
  way (issued by hand in the admin, bought in the store) have no suffix and get
  the original email unchanged.

  The promo version has three stages, chosen by the date the email is sent:
    before REMIND_1_DATE            → first email (sent when the card is created)
    REMIND_1_DATE .. REMIND_2_DATE  → first reminder
    REMIND_2_DATE and later         → second (last) reminder
  Reminders are re-sends of this same notification (giftCardSendNotificationToCustomer).

  The suffix must match in three places: .env, the notification templates
  (subject + this body) and the theme's templates/gift_card.gift-card-promo.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} ===== 活动日期：由 node index.js preview 按 .env 自动更新，请勿手改 ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign promo_remind_1 = 20261012 -%}
{%- assign promo_remind_2 = 20261016 -%}
{%- comment -%} ===== 活动日期结束 ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign promo_suffix = 'gift-card-promo' -%}
{%- assign is_promo = false -%}
{%- if gift_card.template_suffix == promo_suffix -%}{%- assign is_promo = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign promo_today = 'now' | date: '%Y%m%d' | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign promo_stage = 'first' -%}
{%- if promo_today >= promo_remind_2 -%}{%- assign promo_stage = 'remind2' -%}{%- elsif promo_today >= promo_remind_1 -%}{%- assign promo_stage = 'remind1' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign promo_valid_through = '' -%}
{%- if gift_card.expires_on -%}{%- capture promo_valid_through -%}{{ gift_card.expires_on | date: '%B %-d, %Y' }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- capture promo_legal -%}{%- if promo_valid_through != '' -%}<p style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">PROMOTIONAL GIFT CARD · VALID THROUGH {{ promo_valid_through | upcase }}</p>{%- endif -%}{%- endcapture -%}

{% if is_promo %}
{% if promo_stage == 'remind2' %}
{% capture email_title %}Last chance to use your credit{% endcapture %}
{% capture email_body %}<center>{{ promo_legal }}Hi{% if gift_card.customer %} {{ gift_card.customer.first_name }}{% endif %}, this is your final reminder: your exclusive Online Credit Code{% if promo_valid_through != '' %} can be used through {{ promo_valid_through }}{% endif %}.<br><br>Don't let it go to waste. Tap the button below to reveal it and use it on your next order.<br><br>Treat this code like cash and save this email for future reference.</center>{% endcapture %}
{% capture button_text %}Use your Online Credit Code{% endcapture %}
{% elsif promo_stage == 'remind1' %}
{% capture email_title %}Your surprise is still waiting{% endcapture %}
{% capture email_body %}<center>{{ promo_legal }}Hi{% if gift_card.customer %} {{ gift_card.customer.first_name }}{% endif %}, your exclusive Online Credit Code from {{ shop.name }} hasn't been used yet.<br><br>{% if promo_valid_through != '' %}It's valid through {{ promo_valid_through }}. {% endif %}Tap the button below to reveal it and treat yourself.<br><br>Treat this code like cash and save this email for future reference.</center>{% endcapture %}
{% capture button_text %}Reveal your Online Credit Code{% endcapture %}
{% else %}
{% capture email_title %}A little surprise, just for you{% endcapture %}
{% capture email_body %}<center>{{ promo_legal }}Hi{% if gift_card.customer %} {{ gift_card.customer.first_name }}{% endif %}, we've set aside an exclusive Online Credit Code with your name on it, as a thank-you for being part of the {{ shop.name }} family.<br><br>How much is it worth? Tap the button below to reveal your code and find out.<br><br>{% if promo_valid_through != '' %}Your code is valid through {{ promo_valid_through }}. {% endif %}Treat this code like cash and save this email for future reference.</center>{% endcapture %}
{% capture button_text %}Reveal your Online Credit Code{% endcapture %}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
{% capture email_title %}Your Online Credit Code is now available! {% endcapture %}
{% capture email_body %}<center>Hi{% if gift_card.customer %} {{ gift_card.customer.first_name }}{% endif %}, here is your {{ gift_card.balance | money_without_trailing_zeros }} online credit code.<br><br>Treat this code like cash and save this email for future reference.</center>{% endcapture %}
{% capture button_text %}View your Online Credit Code{% endcapture %}
{% endif %}
<!-- promo-stage: {% if is_promo %}{{ promo_stage }}{% else %}original{% endif %} -->

